hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"191","[AI-translation] Tum mein se koi khana shuru kare to Allah ke naam se kahe; shuru mein bhule to yaad aane par kahe: shuru-aakhir mein Allah ke naam se. [Khane se pehle]"
"192","[AI-translation] Allah jise khilae woh kahe: Ae Allah! Is mein hamein barkat de aur is se behtar khila. Allah jise doodh pilae woh kahe: Ae Allah! Is mein hamein barkat de aur hamein zyada de."
